  "strings": [
    "Caring not at all the cost\u0000",
    "the Dark Lord's servants have regained for him the One Ring.\u0000",
    "Sensing that the tide has turned...\u0000",
    "the Free People of Middle-earth must now retreat\u0000",
    "and prepare to defend their realms.\u0000",
    "The power of Sauron is restored\u0000",
    "and few who still survive this war dare hope to oppose him.\u0000",
    "But the Dark Lord's pride remains stung by Gondor's recent victories\u0000",
    "and he intends to extract full retribution.\u0000",
    "With new and vast powers, Sauron now resurrects his fallen chattel.\u0000",
    "He calls again to life many of his darkest heroes and champions...\u0000",
    " to slay once more in his name.\u0000"
  ]
